  9   4010              ; Six tables of sprites in turn, 8 frames each. The interrupt routine, in
 10   4010              ; mode 2, reads the status at the end of every paper, once, and keeps it in
 11   4010              ; a list at log; the program sends each table after a paper has ended.
 12   4010              IM2_TABLE EQU $C200             ; 257 bytes of $C3: every vector is $C3C3
 13   4010              IM2_JUMP  EQU $C3C3             ; and there, a JP to the routine
